  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/geZ7ilkE/ce24330967cfcfd8d53e2ffca1f3eedb878baf6a_96.webp\" alt=\"Beltborne Lanterns 圖示\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:0\"><a style=\"display:inline-block;text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fbeltborne-lanterns-accessories-layer\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" height=\"48\"> </a> <a style=\"display:inline-block;text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/beltborne-lanterns-accessories-layer\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" height=\"48\"> </a> <a style=\"display:inline-block;text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://discord.gg/9JRb3JMAD3\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Discord\" height=\"48\"> </a> <a style=\"display:inline-block;text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://github.com/Shadscure/Beltborne-Lanterns-Accessories-Layer\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/github_vector.svg\" alt=\"GitHub\" height=\"48\"> </a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/Shadscure/Beltborne-Lanterns-Accessories-Layer?display_name=release&amp;sort=semver&amp;style=flat-square&amp;color=00ae5d\" alt=\"最新版本\"></p><h1>Beltborne Lanterns：配件層</h1><p><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbeltborne-lanterns\" rel=\"nofollow\">Beltborne Lanterns</a></strong> 與 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252faccessories\" rel=\"nofollow\">Accessories</a></strong>（WispForest）之間的相容性橋接模組。</p><p>將你的燈籠裝備在 Accessories 的 <strong>腰帶</strong> 欄位——它的運作方式與預設腰帶相同：隨物理效果擺動、投射動態光源，並讓你的雙手保持自由。</p><h2>🧩 功能說明</h2><ul>\n<li>將所有 Beltborne Lanterns 物品註冊為有效的 <strong>腰帶</strong> 配件。</li>\n<li>同步腰帶狀態——無論透過 Accessories 裝備或按下 <strong>B</strong> 鍵皆可無縫運作。</li>\n<li>完整支援客戶端與伺服器：在其他玩家身上渲染燈籠，並為所有人發射光源。</li>\n</ul><h2>📷 展示畫面</h2><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e499a9ed6b778db2300cc1e6f7faa1779ffdafb7_0.webp\" alt=\"展示圖片\"></p><h2>⚙️ 需求</h2><ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbeltborne-lanterns\" rel=\"nofollow\">Beltborne Lanterns</a></strong> —— 核心模組</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252faccessories\" rel=\"nofollow\">Accessories</a></strong> —— WispForest 開發的配件 API</li>\n</ul><h3>🔧 給模組包製作者的提示</h3><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>預設情況下，燈籠僅能放置在 <strong>腰帶</strong> 欄位。你可以透過編輯 <code>config/bl_accessories_layer.json</code>（首次啟動時自動生成）來自訂設定：</p>\n<pre><code>{\n  \"allowed_slots\": [\"belt\"]\n}</code></pre>\n<p>若要允許額外欄位（例如 <code>charm</code>、<code>necklace</code>），請將其加入清單：</p>\n<pre><code>{\n  \"allowed_slots\": [\"belt\", \"charm\", \"necklace\"]\n}</code></pre>\n<p>無需資料包或物品標籤——本模組會自動處理欄位驗證。</p>\n</div><h2>致謝</h2><ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://github.com/DistantDig\" rel=\"nofollow\">@DistantDig</a></strong> —— 可配置欄位支援的構想（<a href=\"https://github.com/Shadscure/Beltborne-Lanterns-Accessories-Layer/pull/7\" rel=\"nofollow\">#7</a>）</li>\n</ul><h2>📜 授權條款</h2><p>本專案採用 <strong>Apache 授權條款 2.0</strong> —— 詳情請參閱 <a href=\"https://github.com/Shadscure/Beltborne-Lanterns-Accessories-Layer/blob/main/LICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\">LICENSE</a> 檔案。<br>完整授權文字：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.apache.org%252flicenses%252fLICENSE-2.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apache 2.0</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>懷著 ❤️ 為 Minecraft 社群精心打造</em></p>",
